    - Interactive Elements (formatted as `[tag_id] role "label" value="..." disabled=true/false`)
    - Recent Action History (last 6 turns)
    - ReAct Instructions:
      1. Always inspect the outcome of the last action.
      2. If an error is present, adapt immediately (e.g., modify input, close popup).
      3. Never click a disabled button; resolve missing fields first.
      4. Set `is_done: true` only when the ultimate objective is verified.
